2. RFC 6979 test vectors
------------------------

The rfc6979 data directory contains test vectors for deterministic ECDSA
taken from RFC 6979, "Deterministic Usage of the Digital Signature Algorithm
(DSA) and Elliptic Curve Digital Signature Algorithm (ECDSA)" (IETF), and
compiled into a single file for the prime-field curves supported by this
project.
